            <ArticleTitle>The management of pain associated with pediatric procedures.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>941-64</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article provides guidelines for the psychological and pharmacologic management of pain and anxiety for children undergoing medical procedures. The goals of intervention are presented, as well as issues warranting consideration in planning intervention to reduce procedure-related distress.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
